        },
        "image": {
          "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b88449-GmeutusMJLNL.png"
        },
        "description": "Daichi is a 17-year-old high school student who lost his father years prior in a space travel accident, and left his family's home on Tanegashima afterwards. When he sees a rainbow formation on a television broadcast from the Tanegashima Space Center, he returns, and because of his skill at a particular arcade game, it makes him the perfect pilot for the Earth Engine Impacter.\r\n\r\n(Source: Wikipedia)",
